            ("Value-Based Alternative Payment Models (Bundled Payments / BPCI)", "Healthcare Economics", "Managing single episode-of-care payments across acute and post-acute providers.", ["Bundled Payment Episode", "Target Price Reconciliation"]),
            ("Phase 5 Placement Milestone: Revenue Cycle Management Review", "Management Defense", "Presenting denial reduction metrics and Days in A/R performance to CFO.", ["Cash Flow Velocity", "Denial Resolution Rate"]),
